WEBVTT

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:05.600
Musica!

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:16.310
Thank you.

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.310
I'll protect us, no matter the cost.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:50.980
<b>The Light of Haecceitas</b>

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.430
Is the boy in the castle?

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:55.970
Yes.

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:58.120
He went to get Yuri.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:00:59.680
That's impossible.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:03.700
Once you become a demon,
there's no turning back.

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.960
So what?

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:09.710
He had the guts to run his mouth off at me.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:13.510
He'd better be able to
make the impossible possible.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:16.160
Otherwise there would be no point 
in giving him the Chronicle.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.630
Shuza...

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:20.840
Have you been turned, too?

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.870
Bonds...

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.190
..are nothing but trouble.

00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:44.080
Serves you right.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.750
You get hurt because you 
try to protect others.

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.740
I care not about bonds.

00:02:02.740 --> 00:02:06.900
I acknowledge only the strong.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.990
What drivel.

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:13.310
You're the same as everyone else.

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.250
You might as well die with the rest of them.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:19.570
Is that all you have to say?

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.660
I tire of this.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.160
Die.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:42.260
<i>Bonds, my foot.</i>

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:51.440
It's time.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.770
The end of the world is upon us.

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:56.640
It's all over.

00:02:57.580 --> 00:02:59.160
I won't let you end it yet.

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.460
Chronicle!

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.110
As your caretaker, I call upon you!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.100
I'll take it all upon myself.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:25.600
At the cost of your life?

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:30.430
But all that will gain you
is a fleeting moment.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.320
I don't care if it doesn't last long.

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.240
I still believe!

00:03:41.850 --> 00:03:45.460
<i>If that black armor is
made out of Black Element,</i>

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.530
<i>it should be the same as the castle barrier.</i>

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:49.260
<i>In which case...</i>

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.370
I'll destroy it from the inside!

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.050
It's no use.

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:16.310
I have no need of the light anymore.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:33.350
I'll heal him right away!

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.330
You...

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.030
Kain.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:41.430
You're alive!

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:44.590
A scratch like that wasn't enough to kill me.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.300
Give me a break.

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.470
It was a close call.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:51.520
I'm so glad you're here, guys.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:53.180
Of course we are.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.020
The Volunteer Army always 
helps those in need.

00:04:56.020 --> 00:04:59.480
If someone falls,
then someone else props them up.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:02.160
That's how we've always fought.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:04.030
Isn't that right, Captain?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:08.530
Yuri, you aren't alone.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.040
We're all with you.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.910
We'll all give you a hand.

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:16.280
That's what friends are for!

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:23.480
Looks like he won't come to his senses
unless we get that armor off of him.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:28.010
We may have to get a bit rough.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:30.930
Prepare yourself, Captain.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.770
I'm never going to give up on you!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.070
Shut up!

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:44.150
Anything you can't bear by yourself,
we'll bear with you.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.790
Snap out of it!

00:05:57.470 --> 00:06:00.090
I believe in you, Captain!

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:08.790
Aram!

00:06:09.530 --> 00:06:16.290
Come back to us, you idiot!

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:33.370
You're not thinking of going back, are you?

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.870
The crimes I've committed can't be undone.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.570
I'm a tainted sinner.

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.750
I'll only be rejected!

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.310
Surely you understand.

00:06:47.310 --> 00:06:51.260
You could never believe in 
yourself until the end.

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:54.260
That's your weakness.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:55.590
You lost.

00:06:55.590 --> 00:06:57.250
To yourself.

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.100
It all ended.

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:05.390
In this world of darkness.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.640
And yet...

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:14.740
Their light reached me 
as I sunk deep into the darkness.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.350
I want to believe once more.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:23.340
In them, and in myself,
the me that they believe in.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:26.520
Believe?

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.220
After all that happened?

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:31.930
You gave rise to me because 
you lacked belief.

00:07:32.420 --> 00:07:35.590
I am the very weakness of your own heart.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:38.230
A scar that will never heal!

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:42.600
A wound that's turned black 
will continue to rot.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:45.820
That's exactly why I...

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.320
I'll take the wound with me to battle.

00:08:01.320 --> 00:08:04.630
That's my way of atoning.

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.700
Let's go...

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:24.870
Together.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.000
Yuri!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.660
Captain!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.910
Foolish.

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:12.530
I can just stain it all black
as many times as I need.

00:09:23.590 --> 00:09:25.000
Phoena!

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.790
We need to heal her immediately.

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:35.820
Yuri...?

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:38.360
Thank goodness.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.890
You came back to us.

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:42.940
Phoena...

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:57.280
You...

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:58.980
Black King.

00:09:58.980 --> 00:10:01.930
We're going to crush you.

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.220
I knew it. That power...

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:10.290
It's the Light of Haecceitas,
a light that rends darkness.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.210
What a nuisance.

00:10:12.210 --> 00:10:13.370
Die!

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:28.540
Kain!

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:29.440
Michidia!

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:40.460
Aram!

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:44.680
Have you resigned yourself 
to accepting this world again?

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.160
No.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.780
I'm going to defeat you and stop
the world's blackening once and for all!

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:53.360
Don't make me laugh!

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:55.710
No, you don't!

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:04.000
I won't waver ever again!

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:17.500
I will not grant you a future.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:22.980
Since time immemorial,

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:28.120
people have formed bonds with
and hurt one another.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:32.150
The cycle of wrongdoings creates hatred,

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:37.130
culminating in stagnation, 
making the world suffer.

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:43.630
Therefore I exist, to paint 
the world's stagnation black.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:01.200
Furball.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:48.440
Damn it.

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:50.700
I'll pin him down.

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:53.050
Distract him in the meantime.

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:54.000
Got it.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.510
Yuri!

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.720
Furball!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.160
Furball...

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:14.700
Aram!

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:19.190
Why?

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.270
Why do you resist so?

00:14:26.650 --> 00:14:32.220
Humanity is imperfect, foolish, and hopeless.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:37.670
A sorry existence that repeats 
its mistakes over and over.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:43.430
That is why I must save the world.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:45.790
From its grief.

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.980
I must recreate it...

00:14:50.510 --> 00:14:52.950
A new future.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.140
You're wrong.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:01.750
The future exists beyond
those mistakes and that sorrow.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.630
Unless we overcome them, there's no point!

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:08.470
That is utterly foolish!

00:15:17.110 --> 00:15:18.770
Give me a break!

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.330
Yeah, we may be a bunch of fools.

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:26.230
But I love it.

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:28.280
I love this world, with all the people in it.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:31.200
Each one of us tries our hardest to live,

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.470
to find a place where we belong,

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.750
to make friends, and help each other.

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:43.120
I won't let you destroy those bonds!

00:15:49.390 --> 00:15:50.840
He's right.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:54.760
We aren't alone.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.310
We had each other.

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:58.180
That's why we never gave up.

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:01.640
We'll create our own future.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.160
Create not a cycle of hatred and grief,

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:08.370
but bonds!

00:16:08.370 --> 00:16:10.190
Absurd!

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:14.370
So long as we have these bonds,
we'll never lose.

00:16:15.750 --> 00:16:17.240
Take this.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.620
We will...

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.470
Seize our light!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.470
Seize our light!

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:57.770
Has the world chosen you?

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:23.690
Phoena.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.140
Phoena!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:26.590
Phoena!

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.360
Phoena.

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:30.870
Phoena!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.750
Phoena!

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:39.250
Phoena!

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.240
Hang in there.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:42.260
I'll save you.

00:17:44.220 --> 00:17:45.700
No matter what!

00:17:47.190 --> 00:17:48.460
It's no use.

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:53.090
You...

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.100
You cannot save her.

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.940
Not even with your power.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:10.610
Now, Chain Chronicle! As your caretaker,
I call upon you to heed my request!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:17.520
Save her.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.040
Save my daughter's life.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:23.230
My ray of hope!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:39.750
I leave the rest in your hands.

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.650
Phoena.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.900
Wake up, Phoena.

00:19:40.890 --> 00:19:43.630
It's all right now, Phoena.

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:49.060
I believed in all of you.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:51.990
I knew you wouldn't lose hope.

00:19:51.990 --> 00:19:53.320
Pirika.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:00.000
Pirika.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:02.760
Welcome back.

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:09.000
I'm home, everyone.

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:33.550
It seems our song was heard.

00:20:33.550 --> 00:20:34.570
Our wish.

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.300
We are victorious.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:43.100
Rejoice!

00:21:40.380 --> 00:21:41.970
<i>Father...</i>

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:49.890
Even as caretaker, I was consumed 
by the will of the blackness.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:53.660
I've done unforgivable things.

00:21:54.050 --> 00:22:03.720
Please, use the true power of the Chronicle
to rebuild the world I've destroyed.

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:06.190
Yes.

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.170
You've become strong.

00:22:14.860 --> 00:22:19.020
And you've made good friends.

00:22:31.910 --> 00:22:33.090
Phoena.

00:22:35.380 --> 00:22:37.200
We're setting sail soon.

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:50.540
Really.

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:54.260
My son's talking about
joining the Holy Guard now.

00:22:54.260 --> 00:22:54.800
That’s amazing.

00:22:54.800 --> 00:22:56.650
He's dreaming.

00:22:58.620 --> 00:23:00.050
What?

00:23:01.320 --> 00:23:03.370
Two apples, pops.

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:04.360
Let go!

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:04.820
Thanks.

00:23:14.060 --> 00:23:15.330
It's on me.

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:18.580
Where are your friends?

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:21.130
I don't have any.

00:23:21.130 --> 00:23:22.220
I see.

00:23:22.640 --> 00:23:23.720
Aram.

00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:26.620
Hurry up.

00:23:29.070 --> 00:23:31.650
Want to come with us?
